@startuml
title Audio Feature — Client Scheduling & Engine
actor "Browser / UI" as UI
participant "PlayerProvider (client)" as Player
participant "AudioScheduler (lib/audio)" as Scheduler
participant "MusicEngine (lib/audio)" as Engine

UI -> Player : click Play(trackId)
Player -> Scheduler : scheduleTrack(trackId, genre, duration, refs, onProgress, onEnd)
Scheduler -> Engine : resetAudioContext() / getSecondsPerBar()
Scheduler -> Engine : scheduleBar(...) // repeated per-bar
Scheduler --> Player : progress events / onEnd
Player --> UI : update UI (progress, end)

note right
Audio engine is client-side using Web Audio API.
Server receives analytics events separately.
end note

@enduml